Project(method, count, percent)
└─ Limit(10)
   └─ Sort(count NULLS LAST, method NULLS FIRST)
      └─ Compute(percent = round((CAST(count AS float) / __total) * 100.0, 2))
         └─ Window[partition](__total = sum(count))
            └─ Aggregate(count = count() BY method)
               └─ Scan(logs)
